# Privacy Policy for Adv.Weekly Report

**Last Updated**: October 3, 2026

## Data Collection

**Adv.Weekly Report does not collect, transmit, or store any telemetry, analytics, or personal data.**

All processing occurs locally within your YouTrack instance and your browser.

## External Services

**The app does not contact any external services.** All export operations (XLSX generation) are performed entirely within the YouTrack app runtime and the user's local browser environment.

## Data Processing

- The app reads YouTrack issues and custom fields via YouTrack's internal API to generate export files and render the dashboard widget
- Generated XLSX files are constructed locally and delivered directly to the user's browser as downloads without intermediate servers
- No issue content, user data, or credentials are logged or transmitted to third parties

## Contact

For privacy-related questions, contact: apps@mag1.cc
